tent="1-143489">Learn more about Sheffield Climate Investment</div><div data-ai-no-open-words="" data-content="1-143490">The first phase of Sheffield Climate Investment closed early, in January 2026, having raised the full £1 million target. The next phase of investment will be launching soon, sign up for updates to get more news.</div><div data-ai-no-open-button-text="" data-content="1-143491">Sign up for updates</div><div data-ai-no-open-button-url="" data-content="1-143492">/signup-for-updates</div><div data-ai-no-past-invest-header="" data-content="1-143493">Placeholder</div><div data-ai-no-past-invest-copy="" data-content="1-143494">placeholder</div><div data-ai-no-past-invest-button-url="" data-content="1-143495">/</div><div data-ai-no-past-invest-button-text="" data-content="1-143496">Learn more</div><div data-ai-no-chart-img-url="" data-content="1-143497">https://cdn4.sharein.com/abundance/cms/a8a4f2b3-8ffd-4da1-8e2a-32e3d59ef654.jpg</div><div data-ai-no-chart-img-alt="" data-content="1-143498">An image of a greening project</div><div data-ai-no-chart-img-caption="" data-content="2-143499">Sheffield City Council has been investing in green energy projects across the city.</div></div><section class="position-relative bg-colour--primary-surface p-t-spacer-4xl type-white ai-hero" style="background:#133478"><div class="container"><div class="row brand-media-box align-items-start"><div class="col-12 col-md-8"><h1 class="text-choke-md--640 text-center--md font-secondary" style="color:#fff" data-content="1-143500">Sheffield City Council</h1><p class="body--xl text-choke-md--640 text-center--md m-b-spacer-sm" style="color:#fff" data-content="2-143504">Join Sheffield City Council in cutting emissions and tackling climate change</p></div><div class="col-12 col-md-4"><div class="ai-heroLogoRail"><img class="image-responsive hero-header__illustration brand-media-box__img" src="https://cdn4.sharein.com/abundance/cms/f2cacfae-c935-496a-9ae8-3badd199ad51.png" alt="Sheffield City Council logo" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"></div></div></div></div></section><div class="bg-colour--primary-surface bg-mask bg-mask--b-convex m-b-spacer-2xl ai-hero-mask" style="background:#133478"></div><div id="ai-scope-wrap"><section class="m-b-spacer-lg ai-scope"><div class="container text-choke-960"><div class="row"><div class="col-12 text-center" data-content="2-143509"><p class="body--xl">Sheffield City Council has launched an exciting new way for people and businesses to take direct action on climate change — by investing in Sheffield’s future through the Sheffield Climate Investment. This investment&nbsp;gives residents the opportunity to invest as little as £5 in projects that make Sheffield greener and more resilient, letting you play an active role in shaping a more sustainable city.</p><p class="body--xl">This investment brings together communities, businesses, and the council to raise funds for local projects that tackle climate change — from renewable energy installations to improving energy efficiency in homes and public buildings.</p><blockquote class="brand-blockquote"><p class="font-secondary">We have said before that tackling climate change in Sheffield isn’t something the Council can do alone. We need to involve not only the business community, but each and every person who calls this fantastic city home. The launch of the Sheffield Climate Investment shows that we really are in this together and, by working together, we can make a real difference.</p><footer class="choke-600 w-100 mx-auto"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn4.sharein.com/abundance/83e5eadb-fdd9-46c9-bb69-ba2841013d62.png" alt="Ben Miskell" title="Image: https://cdn4.sharein.com/abundance/a9e4b45b-669d-4d74-810d-ff8d36ba4983.png"><div><p>Cllr Ben Miskell</p><cite>Chair of the Transport, Regeneration and Climate Policy Committee, Sheffield City Council</cite></div></footer></blockquote></div></div></div></section><div class="bg-colour--primary-surface bg-mask bg-m